Hello, robinsons!

What's new in the latest Space Robinson update?

[h1]New weapons:[/h1]
[list]
[*] Explosive Grenade Launcher;
[*] Proton Rocket Launcher;
[*] Ice Machine Gun.
[/list]

[h1]New perks: [/h1]
[list]
[*] Minifridge; 
[*] Golden Revolver; 
[*] Crystal Compass; 
[*] Photon Sword; 
[*] Boxing Glove; 
[*] Alen Puppy; 
[*] Winged Piglet; 
[*] Raccoon Cub.
[/list]

[h1]Bug fixes: [/h1]
[list]
[*] Now invisible enemies from the jungle become visible even if they were killed in an invisible state; 
[*] Now the Dog doesn't forget to attack the boss.
[/list]

[h1]General changes:[/h1]
[list]
[*] Weapon change time reduced by 33%;
[*] Added timer of current run in the upper right; 
[*] Some monsters (see the pic below) changed their attack sound so that you'll be able to distinguish it from other enemies shots.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33857427/e29ba3369446f966b6ef655f559d17e3c32ee1d0.png[/img]

Today the VAST corporation reported on what has been done in 24 hours.

[list]
[*] Slightly nerfed the monsters on the last level of Desert Plain;
[*] Fixed a bug with a twitching screen if playing on a gamepad;
[*] Fixed an exploit that allowed gaining a huge amount of health using the difficulty configurator (Thanks to @Manifest);
[*] Added Mac-support;
[*] Minor bugfixes and improvements.
[/list]

This couldn’t have been done without your feedback and support! Let’s move on.
